<%= render 'shared/alert_error', alert_heading: t('alerts.failure_to_proof.heading'), alert_text: t('alerts.failure_to_proof.text') %>

<div>
  <h3>What you can do:</h3>
  <p>
    For problems with your Login.gov account, please review <a href="https://login.gov/help/" target="_blank">Login.gov's Help Section</a>
    or contact them at <a href="https://login.gov/contact/" target="_blank">login.gov/contact</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you've taken steps above and still can't verify your identity, please contact <a href="mailto:team@challenge.gov" target="_blank">team@challenge.gov</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    You still may have access to the Challenge.gov platform without verifying your identity, but your access will be limited to non-sensitive
    information. Please proceed to login at the top of thte page.
  </p>
</div>